libavif
------------------------------------------
This library aims to be a friendly, portable C implementation of the AV1 Image
File Format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libaom-devel-3.15.2-1
  libaom3-3.15.2-1
  libavif-devel-1.4.2-1bl2
  libavif16-1.4.2-1bl2
  libdav1d-devel-1.5.4-1
  libdav1d7-1.5.4-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libjpeg8-3.2.0-1
  libpng16-1.6.59-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libsvtav1-devel-4.2.0-1
  libsvtav1enc4-4.2.0-1
  libwebp-devel-1.6.0-1
  libwebp7-1.6.0-1
  libxml2-2.13.9-2
  libyuv0-0.0.1974-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  ImageMagick-7.1.2.30-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libaom-devel-3.15.2-1
  libdav1d-devel-1.5.4-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libjpeg-devel-3.2.0-1
  libpng-devel-1.6.59-1
  libsvtav1-devel-4.2.0-1
  libwebp-devel-1.6.0-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-2
  libyuv-devel-0.0.1974-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/AOMediaCodec/libavif

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/AOMediaCodec/libavif/archive/refs/tags/v1.4.2.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libavif-1.4.2-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libavif-1.4.2-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libavif-1.4.2-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libavif-1.4.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libavif16-1.4.2-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libavif-devel-1.4.2-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libavif)
  /usr/bin/avifdec.exe
  /usr/bin/avifenc.exe
  /usr/bin/avifgainmaputil.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libavif.README
  /usr/share/doc/libavif/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/libavif/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libavif/README.md

(libavif16)
  /usr/bin/cygavif-16.dll

(libavif-devel)
  /usr/include/avif/avif.h
  /usr/include/avif/avif_cxx.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/libavif/libavif-config-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libavif/libavif-config-version.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libavif/libavif-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/libavif.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libavif.pc

